{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Constitution 17 or higher\n\nWith great fortitude of body and experience in battle, you have learned to emulate adamantine both offensively and defensively. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- Weapons you wield are treated as adamantine. Your unarmed strikes are similarly treated as adamantine weapons.\n\n- When an attack roll made against you would score a critical hit, you may negate the critical hit, causing the attack to instead be treated as a normal hit. You can use this ability a number of times equal to your Constitution modifier (minimum of 1) and you can\u0027t use it again until you finish a long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customf286d712-6cec-4762-9973-596a38da5f05","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Adamantine Spirit [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}